# Franca — environment
#
# There is nothing to set. The engine takes no configuration, calls nothing,
# and runs identically on a laptop with no accounts. That is deliberate: the
# kill test in BRIEF.md §10 happens before any of this product's infrastructure
# exists, and it happens on this engine.
#
# When the pipeline around the engine lands, the keys below arrive with it.
# They are listed now only so it is obvious which parts of the brief's §7
# pipeline are not built yet.

# Rewrite drafting, and one day claim extraction. Never verdicts — CLAUDE.md,
# law 1. Without a key the exact fixes still run and every note keeps its
# rule's remedy; `--rewrite` says which it used.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
#
# The same key under a name nothing else claims, checked first. Inside a coding
# agent a value set as ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is the agent's own credential and is
# stripped before it reaches this process — it looks like the key is missing
# while the dashboard shows one set. Use this name there.
# ASSAY_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# The drafter's model and effort. Defaults to claude-opus-5 at the API default.
# REWRITE_MODEL=claude-opus-5
# REWRITE_EFFORT=high

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ fetching
#
# Who to contact about the requests this makes. It goes into the user-agent of
# every page read, and it should be set before a real kill-test run: the whole
# motion is reading a stranger's page and then writing to that stranger, and an
# anonymous crawler in their logs is the first thing that conversation is about.
# SCAN_CONTACT=you@yourdomain.example

# Persistence, the score page and the badge. Not built.
# SUPABASE_URL=
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
